jobs:"site|Site / location|t|1\nonsite|On-site contact|t|0\nequip|Equipment / asset|t|0\nserial|Serial number|t|0\ncat|Category|s:Hardware,Software,Network,Server,Cloud,Industry 4.0,Wireless,Other|1\nestcost|Estimated cost|n|0\nsla|SLA response|s:None,4 hours,Next business day,48 hours|0\nstart|Start date|d|0\nremote|Remote job|c|0\nclientpo|Client PO number|t|0\nresolution|Resolution notes|a|0\nfollowup|Follow-up date|d|0",
